arture time section\n- `filter-departure-morning` - Morning checkbox\n- `filter-departure-afternoon` - Afternoon checkbox\n- `filter-departure-evening` - Evening checkbox\n- `filter-departure-night` - Night checkbox\n\n**Arrival Time Filter Section:**\n- `filter-arrival-time-section` - Arrival time section\n- `filter-arrival-morning` - Morning checkbox\n- `filter-arrival-afternoon` - Afternoon checkbox\n- `filter-arrival-evening` - Evening checkbox\n- `filter-arrival-night` - Night checkbox\n\n### Flight Result Cards\n**File: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/FlightResultCard.tsx`**\n\n**Main Card:**\n- `flight-card-{id}` - Main flight card container\n- `flight-card-main-{id}` - Clickable main section\n\n**Airline Section:**\n- `flight-card-logo-{id}` - Airline logo circle\n- `flight-card-airline-{id}` - Airline name\n- `flight-card-flightnum-{id}` - Flight number\n\n**Time & Route Section:**\n- `flight-card-departure-{id}` - Departure time\n- `flight-card-arrival-{id}` - Arrival time\n- `flight-card-day-{id}` - Day indicator (+1, +2, etc.)\n\n**Duration & Stops:**\n- `flight-card-duration-{id}` - Flight duration\n- `flight-card-stops-{id}` - Stops information\n\n**Emissions & Price:**\n- `flight-card-co2-{id}` - CO2 emissions\n- `flight-card-price-{id}` - Total price\n\n**Expanded Details Section:**\n- `flight-card-details-{id}` - Details container\n- `flight-card-loading-{id}` - Loading indicator\n\n**Leg Breakdown:**\n- `flight-card-leg-{id}-{legOrder}` - Individual flight leg\n- `flight-card-leg-{id}-single` - Single leg (nonstop) display\n- `flight-card-layover-{id}-{index}` - Layover information\n\n**Amenities & Baggage:**\n- `flight-card-amenities-{id}` - Amenities container\n- `flight-card-wifi-{id}` - Wi-Fi amenity\n- `flight-card-power-{id}` - Power outlet amenity\n- `flight-card-entertainment-{id}` - Entertainment amenity\n- `flight-card-baggage-{id}` - Baggage allowance\n\n**Actions:**\n- `flight-card-select-{id}` - Select flight button\n\n### Search Summary Bar\n**File: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/SearchSummaryBar.tsx`**\n- `search-summary-bar` - Main summary bar container\n- `summary-origin` - Origin chip\n- `summary-origin-editor` - Origin editor dropdown\n- `summary-destination` - Destination chip\n- `summary-destination-editor` - Destination editor dropdown\n- `summary-dates` - Dates chip\n- `summary-departure-editor` - Departure date editor\n- `summary-return-date` - Return date chip\n- `summary-return-editor` - Return date editor\n- `summary-passengers` - Passengers chip\n- `summary-passengers-editor` - Passengers selector editor\n- `summary-passengers-done` - Apply button for passengers\n- `summary-cabin-class` - Cabin class chip\n- `summary-cabin-editor` - Cabin class selector editor\n- `summary-cabin-done` - Apply button for cabin class\n\n### Pagination\n**File: `/repo/apps/GoogleFlights/src/components/Pagination.tsx`**\n- `pagination` - Pagination container\n- `pagination-load-more` - Load more button\n- `pagination-loading` - Loading state indicator\n\nAll file paths are absolute paths from the repository root, and the structure clearly shows the separation between the results list, filter sidebar, and individual flight cards that make up the search results page."}],"totalDurationMs":27408,"totalTokens":54051,"totalToolUseCount":20,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4222,"cache_read_input_tokens":48104,"output_tokens":1718,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":4222},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
